abstract: >-
  Exact certificates and reproducible checks exclude ten specified cases
  within one signed Fourier geometry in the search for a 14-variable
  Boolean function of real degree at most five and full origin sensitivity.
  The full existence question remains open. Isolated replay passed 138
  controls and all ten case checks; historical reductions remain documented
  dependencies. Substantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed. Human peer
  review, proof-assistant formalization and novelty are not established.
